**AI SETUP SCORE**

Personal AI Audit — 10 Questions, 5 Dimensions, Scored out of 50

kylerosebrook.com

**How to use this scorecard**

Rate yourself honestly on each question from 1 to 5. Add up your scores per dimension (max 10 each) and total (max 50). Find your band in the scoring table at the end.

Scoring key: 1 = not at all / default mode    5 = fully built out and deliberate

**01  PROFILE**

*Does AI know who you are and how you work?*

| **Q1  Do you have a custom AI profile that tells your tools your role, communication style, and goals?** |
| --- |
| **1** | I use every tool in default mode — no customization at all |
| **2** | I've added a one-liner bio in one tool |
| **3** | I have a basic profile set up in my main AI tool |
| **4** | I have a detailed profile across multiple tools |
| **5** | Role-specific profiles with goals, tone, and constraints deployed everywhere |

| **Q2  When you start a new task in AI, how much context does it already have about your work?** |
| --- |
| **1** | Nothing — every session starts completely from scratch |
| **2** | I paste context manually each time I need it |
| **3** | My main tool has some saved memory or notes |
| **4** | I maintain project-level context in one place |
| **5** | Persistent, structured context lives across tools — I update it regularly |

